Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.83,Hook,,0,0,0,,LA SEÑORA QUERÍA PELEA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Epa, epa, epa, señora,\Nseñora.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:05.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿Crees que te tengo\Nmiedo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:08.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Te crees muy rudo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.66,0:00:09.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿verdad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.81,0:00:11.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¡Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.35,0:00:13.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Por qué son tan\Nagresivos?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.43,0:00:15.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿Eres un maldito maniquí?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:19.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Es demasiado para ti?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:21.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¡Dale!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dios mío!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.49,0:00:23.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué carajo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:26.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dios mío!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:28.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Es en serio?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:30.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—De nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:31.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿Qué está
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:33.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}pasando?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:35.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Tiene suerte de que tengo\Ntrabajo, señora.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.41,0:00:38.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Tiene suerte de que tengo\Ntrabajo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:38.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Dios mío.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:40.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Solo quería ver qué\Npasaba.
